<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div><div><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Congratulations! You have been awarded the ASU Scholastic Award of $1,000 per year, which is renewable three times, for four award years. You can view and accept this award in <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> under the <b>Finances</b> tab.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">Remember to keep checking your <b>Priority Task</b> list on <a href="https://my.asu.edu">My ASU</a> for any items you need to complete before enrolling.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">If you haven't done so already, your next step to becoming a Sun Devil is to <a href="https://students.asu.edu/freshman/deposit">pay your enrollment deposit</a> in <a href="https://my.asu.edu">My ASU</a>. Once you submit your enrollment deposit, you will be able to complete your next steps, such as signing up for housing and for orientation, where you will register for classes. &nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">I am happy to answer any questions you may have about your enrollment steps or your latest scholarship award.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Go Devils!</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>